    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome back to the world where you will only find liminality and loneliness... now with better graphics. But remember, don't get lost in this dream.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overall Game Info:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Solitude Project is a complete rework and a Spin-Off of A Liminal Place Legacy (also known as Remastered), now featuring HWRT (Hardware Ray Tracing) and Fully Simulated RT Lights (Psycho mode), better physics (at least a bit better), a new puzzle, improved optimization, and more! (Still no save function.) Find your way to the next level, do whatever you want! But remember... you will never find the exit.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But at least you\u2019ll have some relaxing and nostalgic environments. The game is very short, but I\u2019ll try to expand it with more DLCs or storylines.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game made by a teenager.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Gameplay Features (Including missing features):</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hardware Ray-Traced Reflections and GI.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fully Simulated Lightning (Ray Tracing / Path Tracing, optional)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Better environments and better textures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Better optimization.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Music radios in some levels :D.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Some floaties.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Water physics (Missing).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Footstep system (Missing).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- NO SAVES. (Not a feature, but let\u2019s give it a go again.) </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\u201cThe choice is yours, wanderer.\u201d</i></strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome back to the world where you will only find liminality and loneliness... now with better graphics. But remember, don't get lost in this dream.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overall Game Info:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Solitude Project is a complete rework and a Spin-Off of A Liminal Place Legacy (also known as Remastered), now featuring HWRT (Hardware Ray Tracing) and Fully Simulated RT Lights (Psycho mode), better physics (at least a bit better), a new puzzle, improved optimization, and more! (Still no save function.) Find your way to the next level, do whatever you want! But remember... you will never find the exit.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But at least you\u2019ll have some relaxing and nostalgic environments. The game is very short, but I\u2019ll try to expand it with more DLCs or storylines.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game made by a teenager.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Gameplay Features (Including missing features):</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hardware Ray-Traced Reflections and GI.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fully Simulated Lightning (Ray Tracing / Path Tracing, optional)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Better environments and better textures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Better optimization.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Music radios in some levels :D.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Some floaties.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Water physics (Missing).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Footstep system (Missing).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- NO SAVES. (Not a feature, but let\u2019s give it a go again.) </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\u201cThe choice is yours, wanderer.\u201d</i></strong></p>",
